New 1+1 bedroom flat with private terrace of 15.60 sqm in Madalena, Vila Nova de Gaia. Completion of the work and deed scheduled for 2026.

Live close to the sea, with the city on your doorstep and everything you need for everyday life just minutes from home.

In the final stages of construction and scheduled for completion in October 2026, this elegant T1+1 in Madalena, Vila Nova de Gaia, stands out for its functional distribution, balanced areas and private terrace of 15.60 m², a true extension of the house, ideal for outdoor dining, leisure time or simply to enjoy the outdoors.

With approximately 55 m² of interior area, the flat was carefully designed to provide comfort and functionality, making efficient use of each space.

A distribution designed for everyday life

The social area consists of a living room and kitchen in an open space concept with 22.40 m², creating a large, modern and functional environment, with excellent connection to the outdoor space.

The private area includes a bedroom with 14.50 m², complemented by a private bathroom of 5.30 m², forming a suite with about 19.80 m².

The property also has an additional space of 5.10 m², currently identified as storage, which can take on different functions according to the needs of the future owner, such as office, support area or complementary space.

It also has a second full bathroom with 3.40 m² and an entrance hall with 4.30 m².

Main features

- Approximately 55 m² of interior area;

- Private terrace with 15.60 m²;

- Suite with approximately 19.80 m²;

- Room with 14.50 m²;

- Living room and kitchen in open space with 22.40 m²;

- Additional space of 5.10 m² for storage;

- Two full bathrooms;

- Wardrobes;

- Private parking space;

- New construction;

- Contemporary finishes and quality materials;

- Completion scheduled for October 2026;

- Deed expected in 2026.

A privileged location between the sea and the city

Located in Madalena, Vila Nova de Gaia, this development benefits from a location that combines residential tranquillity with proximity to the beaches, Porto and all essential services.

Nearby you will find:

- Madalena beaches about 5 minutes;

- Train Station about 3 minutes;

- GaiaShopping and Arrábida Shopping about 6 minutes;

- Pingo Doce about 3 minutes walk;

- Pharmacy about 3 minutes walk;

- Schools about 3 minutes walk;

- Main road accesses about 3 minutes.

A location designed for those who value the proximity to the sea, but want to maintain quick access to Porto and the main urban centres.

An opportunity to live or invest

The combination of new construction, location, proximity to beaches and private terrace makes this T1+1 an interesting solution for both own housing and investment.

It can be an excellent option for permanent residence, second home or rental, benefiting from the demand for new properties in a consolidated area close to Porto.

